{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ecb7ed9cfbeb7cbe22bf9a39c5e9bd77b61a433e1df11a371d2470a0cc0aa3d4", "ja": "明日に向かって", "zh": "迎向明天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cdaec57e391a365d64629e77cd3718217f35cf800fdc8149a20fbdac51a53fdf", "ja": "プロジェクトはいよいよ本格始動。アイドル\nたちも、レッスンに力が入っている様子。建\n設が進む劇場、仮縫いの衣装、高まる結束。\nデビューに向けた準備が着々と整っていく。\nすべては、眩しく光る明日のために。", "zh": "项目终于正式启动。偶像\n们似乎也干劲十足地投入了训练。剧\n场建设正在推进，服装正在试缝，团\n结也日益增强。为出道所做的准备正\n在有条不紊地进行着。\n一切，都是为了那耀眼的明天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "9455322f302bdd201fc1e59842217b3c8365ab1f52edf2b5de13feb00da6d5d2", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "b334bc522a3308fa4b0b9bb1ce4a2e55e6a4768efde89625850e1a222f491f51", "ja": "いち、に、さん、し……！", "zh": "一、二、三、四……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "5c7db6804985ab754d0b35f919db838bb05e773c47ef975ddba5a3ae5ada99c5", "ja": "ポーズで、フィニッシュです～！　はぁ、はぁ……\nす、少しブレイクタイムにしましょう～！", "zh": "摆好姿势，完成啦～！呼、呼……\n稍、稍微休息一下吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "0263564f71214332fc0d7db0b91d08c384b4bcb9477445f9ba8d76d8c8d2575a", "ja": "お疲れさま！　みんな気合い入ってるな。\nあ、水分補給も忘れるなよ！", "zh": "辛苦了！大家都干劲十足啊。\n啊，别忘了补充水分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "4eaaa9368f46b141d54e7e2b4b250ca10694d2ee924f699a06ddb3d1e6851ba3", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。最後のオーディションも\n終わって、いよいよ本格始動ですからね～。むんっ。", "zh": "谢谢您～。最后的试镜也结束了，\n终于要正式开始了嘛～。嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "f38858dc6f0bc12074ae090e12f2903644d31a2cf63dc075f3474b126c0639d2", "ja": "大和撫子として、いつでもごヒイキ様方に初舞台を\nお見せできるよう、準備しておかなくては……！", "zh": "作为大和抚子，为了随时都能向各位主顾\n展现初次登台的身姿，必须好好准备才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e0f752cf8e757ccdaca862f77bced637bfcf0671cf028a443e4be9a7dd2a584", "ja": "そういえば、劇場っていつ正式オープンするの？\n日にちとか決まってる？", "zh": "说起来，剧场什么时候正式开放啊？日期之类的定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "9421b7620d7b3a0fb1eed9c43e7107afa8ed4f282c3db1880610a3ead1b95587", "ja": "肝心のステージがまだ工事中だからな。こけら落としの\n日程は、さすがにまだ決まってないんだ。", "zh": "关键的舞台还在施工中嘛。开幕演出的日程，果然还没定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "7df6f1e716501533ae97e335bfbb809814986cb17635837ddabb62ee69d4ad61", "ja": "でも、初ステージってことなら、\nそんなに遠くないと思う。じつは……。", "zh": "不过，要说初次登台的话，我觉得应该不会太久。其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1009_null", "source_sha256": "f6a0b478451b6f2d1bbebcc8660efafe2d47f5b715e5b3557cd7e402ca0941d8", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャッ。", "zh": "咚咚，咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "a9f9f3851520db06234b517fdbf13589eed2d647da5b4fb119b0401d7589722b", "ja": "お邪魔しま～す。みなさん、お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "打扰啦～大家辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "0d0cd9b58a2c055b087a0f6332164fb9fd83a1f2a98bd6219880779dd3f68b2d", "ja": "あれ？　青羽さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "哎？青羽小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "2b663cceca5dc58466589ec576b8006809cc29107285ff7084f472b3408c1926", "ja": "ミサキ、どうしたんですか？\n……あ、もしかしてロコ達のコスチュームですか！？", "zh": "美咲，怎么了吗？\n……啊，难道是ROCO她们的服装吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "e6547b58a2e8ace9eaff6d8f7bc6869e06d8da0260df38205c3f682839c70364", "ja": "そうなの！　レッスンが終わった後でいいから、\nちょっと時間もらえるかな……？", "zh": "没错！等课程结束后就行，可以稍微给我一点时间吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "f1218c8f3bab1f1600965dc237afda4f21994c15927893b990336c9938d587d8", "ja": "衣装の仮縫いができたから、みんなに試着してみて\nほしくて。プロデューサーさん、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "服装的假缝做好了，想让大家试穿一下。制作人，您方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "912fb724d003add1aa40e85379546ab0d80720ec69e24aab01370d5f2712c302", "ja": "えっ？　あ、はい、時間は大丈夫ですけど……\n仮縫いって……全員分ですか？", "zh": "诶？啊，好的，时间倒是没问题……  \n试穿样衣……是所有人的份吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "cb778e30f1a3078372ee9015859b0e68bd0640ee0cefadc02b6d9dd4f4fa5fb4", "ja": "はい！　すみません、ちょっと時間かかっちゃって。\nあ、大丈夫でしたら私、衣装取ってきますね～♪", "zh": "好的！抱歉，花了点时间。\n啊，没问题的话，我去把演出服拿过来哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd180578c081d5723bf394f7ed13927d25655af450c3ded9b1fb98110fd5000f", "ja": "え……シアタープロジェクト全員分、\n青羽さんひとりで……？　え……？", "zh": "咦……剧场企划全员份的服装，都是青羽小姐一个人……？咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "5fdb49f82650e9cf3a0bb9cc0d63682192d91b380ab77c81c302435ecae0be63", "ja": "そっか……。\n俺も、もっと頑張らなきゃ……！", "zh": "这样啊……\n我也得更加努力才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "582c1ec03e78b39e9fdd9c971cd1a41b32b4c23d8228582c7695eec672c08dff", "ja": "はぁぁ～！　とうとう、とうとう私も、\n大和撫子の正装衣装を身に纏えるのですね……！", "zh": "哈啊啊～！终于，终于连我也能穿上大和抚子的正式服装了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "a29769e6ffa9849d68364463d81a88d41e7e5242c829c9126fd5bd66ed83cfc1", "ja": "エミリー、落ち着きなって。まだ仮縫いだからね？\n……といいつつ、アタシもウキウキしちゃってるけど♪", "zh": "艾米莉，你先冷静点。现在还只是试装呢？\n……话虽如此，我也忍不住兴奋起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "145bce0ef56dfc05fc72754c2d02623df23d48f155904006ec71f9fefc8ab65c", "ja": "で、でも、衣装合わせはレッスンの後でって。\n今はまだ、レッスンの時間だよ……？", "zh": "可、可是，不是说要等练习结束后再试穿服装吗？现在还在练习时间……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "2c55b4bcf2ba597ba8edd81943a5793832130ae911c73d43f83805aa49d9de4b", "ja": "も～、可憐マジメだなぁ。\nアイドルって意外とマジメな子多くない？", "zh": "真是的，可怜也太认真了吧。\n偶像里认真过头的孩子是不是意外地多啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "f5a6a646c997711790d8214ad409062dd3eaac5d847c1a29fed8da91ec0e4087", "ja": "え、そ、そうかな？\nふ、普通だと思うけど……？", "zh": "诶，是、是这样吗？\n我、我觉得很普通啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "b15f9728efd79e10c853047152980b43f8cec3e3583397275428bef850be7ff7", "ja": "ロコはストイックですけど、スケジュールは\nフレキシブルなほうがいいと……思いますよ？", "zh": "ROCO虽然很自律，但我觉得日程还是灵活一点比较好……您觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "0981c1ca4decec508cc30e174cadfed9ce90ba2f64caf815ab4b42756aaec9a6", "ja": "仕方ありませんな～。では、今日のところは、\n次の一回で終わりにしましょう～。", "zh": "没办法了呢～那么，今天就到下一次为止吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "3784e36ece28547fd2e043171058070ff8c00d004be4866ce8f28e3f346c2178", "ja": "明日につなげる、今日の最後の一回ですからね～。\n全力で、いきましょ～！", "zh": "这是今天最后一次，要为明天延续下去哦～  \n我们全力上吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_07_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
